1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,400
Welcome and thank you for taking part in the study.

2
00:00:07,280 --> 00:00:11,120
Today you'll take part in a meditation session, an experiment.

3
00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:19,840
It explores how we experience our own body and self and our sense of being located within our

4
00:00:19,840 --> 00:00:29,440
body and in space. The session has three parts. First, a short experimental task.

5
00:00:30,960 --> 00:00:36,240
Then, a guided meditation experience that is carried out in virtual reality.

6
00:00:37,920 --> 00:00:46,000
And finally, the same experimental task once more. All together, these will take around 30 minutes.

7
00:00:49,680 --> 00:00:54,080
Before we begin, please find a comfortable seated position.

8
00:00:54,480 --> 00:01:00,080
Keep your back straight and let your hands rest gently in your lap.

9
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:05,840
You'll be wearing a virtual reality headset for most of the session.

10
00:01:07,040 --> 00:01:12,080
So take a moment now to make sure your position feels stable and relaxed.

11
00:01:14,080 --> 00:01:16,080
Now let's begin.

